    "Native43AA58..43AAAB arguments match the other three component pickers: outer rect, faction, kind, eligible ordinal, five component values, SpotlightColorTable. Native43AABC..43AAD2 consumes returned ordinal directly, including cancellation. No minus-one correction.",
    "Native433FF5 saves original selected;43404B decrements only kind3 working selection;434413 increments successful kind3 selection;43445C returns saved ordinal on cancel. Preserve these conventions, exhausted scans and original unsafe paths.",
    "Native434006..434039 stores faction/kind/component arguments in2B68 and2B84..2B98. Field2B90 is the armor argument slot with no observed reader, not a proof of downstream armor semantics. Native43403F stores source-owned SpotlightColorTable at4644, independently of unused final palette argument. No consumer established; pointer cleanup and initialization fidelity do not prove user-visible behavior.",
    "Preserve all original identities, spans, claims and seed lessons. Actual-source/mutation tests, pinned instruction anchors, both-profile owner measurements, native member-layout observations, build/link and independent review required. This is not new function coverage or full-game acceptance."
